"""Elysium Designer — visual authoring tool.

Goals (current pass):
  • Toolbox accordion: Controls / Tools / Shapes (no duplicate Text tool).
  • The App Window itself is selectable and editable — its shape, colour,
    gradient and transparency are all properties.
  • The pen tool is freeform (drag to record a path), not line-based.
  • Drawing tools always release on mouseup; auto-switch to Select.
  • Every selectable element exposes Color / Gradient properties via inline
    color picker popovers.
  • macOS hides the in-window menu (NSMenu wiring lands in a follow-up).
  • Status bar + Project Explorer rename Form → App Window.

Usage:
    python -m elysium_designer <path/to/skin.esk>
"""
from __future__ import annotations

